<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico drains 1.153 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico drains 1.153 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed three auctions to drain 1.153 billion pesos of liquidity from the secondary market, dealers said.</p>
<p>AUCTIONS	 TERM    MAX    MIN    AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>450 million pesos  7 days  23.89  23.89  23.89    3    3</p>
<p>450 million pesos  4 days  23.69  23.50  23.69    3    3</p>
<p>253 million pesos  1 day   23.25  23.25  23.25    1    1</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9500))</p>
